In this section you put existing studies that are about the technique you are studying in this thesis.
 For example,
 if you are doing a study on the readability of lambda expressions in Java,
 you mention here those studies that exists about lambdas.
 Do not describe these studies in a way as 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
