.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Describe the experiments that have been executed (each one in its own paragraph oder subchapter).
 Describe its experimental design,
 the way how it has been analyzed,
 the most important numbers that come from the experiment (p-values,
 effect sizes) and the interpretation of the experiment.
 In case there are serious doubts about the validity of the experiment (make sure that these doubts are serious doubts and not just the result of your fantasy),
 mention them as well.
\end_layout

