 it makes sense here to mention studies that show that the choice of the programming language matters.
 Although randomized control trials should always be your first choice,
 it might make sense to take also works as for example the one by Ray et al.
 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "Ray_LargeScaleStudyGitHub_2017"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 into account.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In case you write about a programming language construct,
