\begin_layout Standard
Unlike the two preceding experiments on fixed indentation,
 this experiment found no significant effect of either nesting level or condition word length on reaction time when dynamic indentation was used.
 This stands in contrast to the baseline experiment (see Section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
